bootinf0:Acorn's latest ToolBox modules, needed for running all parts of PCPro.
bootinf1:A patch to fix various bugs in CDFS.
bootinf2:A patch to allow RISC OS (and !PC) to recognise the extra 'Windows' keys found on modern keyboards.
bootinf3:Upgrade so that RISC OS 3.5 users can access DOS partitions bigger than 32MB from RISC OS.
bootinf4:Utility which puts the PC Card into a power-saving mode when the RISC PC starts up.
bootinf5:DOSFS mappings to ensure most common extensions on DOS files (DOC, TXT etc.) are shown as the appropriate filetypes RISC OS.
bootinf6:A utility to stop you accidentally deleting your DOS partitions.
bootinf7:A patch to allow the Filer to sort large directories.
bootinf8:A patch to fix memory allocation on RISCOS 4.03.
bootinf9:A module that makes the 'Web' button on the info window work with browsers other than !Browse.
